  "description": "Supported Platforms:\n• NETStandard\n• UWP\n• NETFramework\n\n\nLoad, convert, and save JPEG 2000 files and code streams as well as utilize advanced JPEG 2000 Part 6 (JPM) features.  \n\nLEADTOOLS JPEG 2000 compression/decompression conforms to the JPEG 2000 International Standard. This state-of-the-art ISO/ITU still image compression provides a fast and flexible solution for high-quality, wavelet-based compression. LEAD is fully committed to support all future parts as they are released. Therefore, LEADTOOLS JPEG 2000 support will continue to grow as the JPEG 2000 standard grows.\n\nThis is just a small part of a large technology offering called LEADTOOLS. To see all that LEADTOOLS has to offer, go to https://www.leadtools.com\n\n\n\nUse the following link to register for a LEADTOOLS license file that is required to use this NuGet.  \nAdditionally, the link provides access to the LEADTOOLS Installer. The Installer includes 100’s of demo applications with source code to jump start your development: \nhttps://bit.ly/LEADTOOLS_NUGET",
